# Upstream KDE Konsole's built-in Breeze colour scheme, compiled into the
# konsole binary as a Qt resource (:/color-schemes/Breeze.colorscheme) —
# there is no /usr/share/konsole/Breeze.colorscheme file to copy on this
# host (Konsole ships its stock schemes as resources, not loose files).
# Fetched verbatim via WebFetch from:
#   https://invent.kde.org/utilities/konsole/-/raw/master/data/color-schemes/Breeze.colorscheme
#   commit dc63dd851547086410604be2733b7d766e03c036, 2023-11-13 (last change to this file on master as of 2026-09-25)
# Licence: GPL-2.0-or-later (KDE Konsole data files)

